    "Reduces energy use by limiting output and, on some Bosch models, selecting at least 24 °C with Auto fan. Bosch does not publish one guaranteed saving versus Cool across all Climate models, and betterBCool does not receive power-use data from this AC, so it cannot show a trustworthy percentage." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing the Eco mode of the AC.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riduce il consumo energetico limitando la potenza e, su alcuni modelli Bosch, impostando almeno 24 °C con ventola automatica. Bosch non pubblica un risparmio garantito rispetto al raffreddamento per tutti i modelli Climate e betterBCool non riceve dati sui consumi di questo climatizzatore, quindi non può mostrare una percentuale attendibile."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reduces energy use by limiting output and, on some Bosch models, selecting at least 24 °C with Auto fan. Bosch does not publish one guaranteed saving versus Cool across all Climate models, and betterBCool does not receive power-use data from this AC, so it cannot show a trustworthy percentage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reduces humidity with gentle, intermittent cooling. Fan speed is automatic, so Quiet, Low, Medium, High and Turbo should not work. Climate 3000i, 5000i and 6000i units normally still allow a temperature setpoint in Dry; some Climate Class models lock it. Eco, Sleep and swing availability depends on the AC model." : {
      "comment" : "Text displayed in a section of a view that explains the Dry mode of an AC.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Riduce l’umidità con un raffreddamento leggero e intermittente. La velocità della ventola è automatica, quindi Silenziosa, Bassa, Media, Alta e Turbo non sono disponibili. I modelli Climate 3000i, 5000i e 6000i normalmente consentono di impostare la temperatura in deumidificazione; alcuni modelli Climate Class la bloccano. La disponibilità di Eco, Sonno e oscillazione dipende dal modello."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reduces humidity with gentle, intermittent cooling. Fan speed is automatic, so Quiet, Low, Medium, High and Turbo should not work. Climate 3000i, 5000i and 6000i units normally still allow a temperature setpoint in Dry; some Climate Class models lock it. Eco, Sleep and swing availability depends on the AC model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
